     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Use Chip as a compact visual to represent user-selected values or active filters that can be dismissed. The label should be brief to maintain clarity and visual balance.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Chips typically appear dynamically as a group inside a Chip Group component. Chip is intended for interactive use where items need to be removed individually. Unlike Tags, chips don't have links, and users can close them. Chips trigger actions but do not transfer the user anywhere.  ",
